-03-15',\r\n             issue: '冷却液泄漏',\r\n             cause: '管路接头松动',\r\n             solution: '紧固接头，更换密封圈',\r\n             duration: '1.5小时',\r\n             staff: '李四'\r\n           }\r\n         ]\r\n       }\r\n     }\r\n   }\r\n </script>\r\n\r\n <style lang=\"scss\" scoped>\r\n   .device-management {\r\n     padding: 24px;\r\n     background-color: #f5f7fa;\r\n\r\n     .page-header {\r\n       margin-bottom: 24px;\r\n     }\r\n\r\n     .section-card {\r\n       margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n\r\n       .section-header {\r\n         font-weight: 600;\r\n         font-size: 16px;\r\n       }\r\n\r\n       .info-grid {\r\n         display: grid;\r\n         grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));\r\n         grid-gap: 12px 24px;\r\n\r\n         .info-item {\r\n           display: flex;\r\n           flex-direction: column;\r\n           padding: 8px 0;\r\n           border-bottom: 1px dashed #ebeef5;\r\n\r\n           .label {\r\n             color: #909399;\r\n             font-size: 13px;\r\n             margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n           }\r\n\r\n           .value {\r\n             color: #303133;\r\n             font-size: 15px;\r\n             font-weight: 500;\r\n             word-break: break-all;\r\n           }\r\n         }\r\n       }\r\n     }\r\n\r\n     .status-dot {\r\n       display: inline-block;\r\n       width: 10px;\r\n       height: 10px;\r\n       border-radius: 50%;\r\n       margin-right: 6px;\r\n       vertical-align: middle;\r\n     }\r\n\r\n     .status-running {\r\n       background-color: #67c23a;\r\n       box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(103, 194, 58, 0.5);\r\n     }\r\n   }\r\n </style>\n"]}]}